From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Balke <fughilli@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 19:55:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add a serial console for Wi-Fi provisioning

esp_console REPL on the console UART: wifi_connect, wifi_set, wifi_mode,
wifi_status (JSON), restart. Every command ends in one @OK/@ERR line so a
host tool (tools/wireless_dap/dap_wifi.py in embedded) can drive it.
